{% include "grounding_rules.j2" %}

TASK: Write Section {{ section_id }}: {{ section_title }}.
Target Length: {{ target_words }} words

SECTION DETAILS:
- Topic: {{ section_title }}
- Microcontroller: {{ brief.implementation.board.mcu_part_number }} ({{ brief.implementation.board.name }})
- Peripherals: {{ brief.implementation.peripherals | join(', ') }}
- Pins:
{% for p in brief.implementation.pins %}
  - {{ p.pin }}: {{ p.peripheral }} connected to {{ p.connected_to }} ({{ p.function }})
{% endfor %}
- Libraries: {{ brief.implementation.libraries | join(', ') }}

Provide a short introductory paragraph followed by a clear, formal list of bullet points detailing {{ section_title }}.
Output strictly JSON: {"paragraphs": ["Introductory statement..."], "bullets": ["Point 1...", "Point 2..."]}
